<title>UK: Eridania ups seven-year FRN to 350 billion lire.</title>
<headline>Eridania ups seven-year FRN to 350 billion lire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to 350 billion lire from 200 billion lire, joint lead managers BCI, Credito Italiano and J.P. Morgan said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The new paper has a 100.27 issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ERIDANIA BEGHIN-SAY</p>
<p> AMT  **350 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    =	   GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS GB/FR/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **ORIGINALLY 200 BLN LIRE AT 100.10.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
